<!--
  Sitemap — Longhand Budget (story seo-1).

  Lists EXACTLY the pages robots.txt leaves indexable, as absolute URLs on the
  production origin (ADR-007: www is canonical, the apex only redirects).
  `src/routes/__tests__/robots-sitemap-coverage.test.ts` fails if this set drifts
  from the route classification in robots.txt — including one /docs/<slug> per
  entry of DOC_PAGES, so adding a document means adding its <loc> here.

  No <lastmod>/<changefreq>/<priority>: Google ignores the last two, and a
  hand-maintained lastmod goes stale and is worse than none.
-->
